---
import BaseLayout from "../../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import MetaPill from "../../../components/ui/MetaPill.astro";
import registry from "../../../data/phase-89-income-wealth-poverty-social-protection-economic-security-registry.json";

const income = registry.household_income_earnings_tax_transfer_resource_dossiers;
const wealth = registry.wealth_assets_debt_liabilities_intergenerational_balance_ledgers;
const protection = registry.poverty_deprivation_social_protection_benefit_access_registers;
const security = registry.economic_security_distribution_shock_mobility_long_horizon_ledgers;
---

<BaseLayout title="Income, Wealth, Poverty, Social Protection And Economic Security | FTFN" description="Thirty-two inactive income, wealth, poverty, social-protection, benefit-access, distribution, mobility, and economic-security records.">
  <section class="page-section hero" data-income-wealth-economic-security-registry><div class="hero__copy"><div class="eyebrow">FTFN / Economic Security</div><h1 class="page-title">An income transfer is not freedom from poverty, and poverty exit is not durable mobility.</h1><p class="lede">Phase 89 traces whether household resources remain adequate after taxes, costs and debt; whether assets are usable and liabilities survivable; whether people can actually reach social protection; and whether prosperity, resilience and mobility endure across shocks, places and generations.</p><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label="8 inactive income dossiers" tone="possibility" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive wealth ledgers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive protection registers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive security ledgers" /><MetaPill label="0 economic-security decisions" tone="review" /></div></div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Household Income, Earnings, Taxes, Transfers And Resources</div><h2>Eight income dossiers remain closed.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/household-income-earnings-resources-001/">Read the household-resource guide</a></div><div class="grid">{income.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.income_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/income-wealth-economic-security/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Income sources, taxes, transfers, public services, essential costs, debt, household composition, timing, administration, distribution, review, and receipts remain empty.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Wealth, Assets, Debt, Liabilities And Intergenerational Balance</div><h2>Eight wealth ledgers contain no household-security finding.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/wealth-assets-liabilities-balance-sheets-001/">Read the balance-sheet guide</a></div><div class="grid">{wealth.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.wealth_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/income-wealth-economic-security/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.wealth_assets_debt_liabilities_intergenerational_balance_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Ownership, control, valuation, liquidity, housing, pensions, business assets, debt, credit, insolvency, inheritance, distribution, mobility, and review remain unassessed.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Poverty, Deprivation, Social Protection And Benefit Access</div><h2>Eight social-protection registers remain inactive.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/benefit-eligibility-take-up-denial-appeal-001/">Read the benefit-access guide</a></div><div class="source-list">{protection.map((record) => <article class="source-row"><div><h3><a href={'/evidence/income-wealth-economic-security/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.poverty_deprivation_social_protection_benefit_access_register_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Poverty depth and persistence, material deprivation, program rules, applications, take-up, denial, delay, sanctions, adequacy, continuity, appeals, restoration, and audit remain unassessed.</p></div><MetaPill label={record.protection_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Distribution, Shocks, Mobility And Long-Horizon Economic Security</div><h2>Eight economic-security ledgers contain no shared-prosperity finding.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/intergenerational-mobility-distribution-shared-prosperity-001/">Read the shared-prosperity guide</a></div><div class="grid">{security.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><h3><a href={'/evidence/income-wealth-economic-security/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.economic_security_distribution_shock_mobility_long_horizon_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Stabilizers, emergency protection, essential security, distribution, concentration, shocks, upward and downward mobility, persistence, community wealth, future generations, and audit remain inactive.</p><MetaPill label={record.security_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section briefing-band"><div class="briefing-band__copy"><div class="eyebrow">Public Contract</div><h2>Inspect the empty economic-security state.</h2><p>The export publishes the complete control surface without treating a transfer as freedom from poverty, earnings as wealth, eligibility as access, growth as shared prosperity, ownership as security, or one poverty exit as durable mobility—and without taxing, transferring, classifying, denying, valuing, scoring, ranking, or changing a stage.</p></div><article class="record-card"><a class="inline-link" href="/data/income-wealth-poverty-social-protection-economic-security.json">Income, wealth, poverty, and protection JSON</a></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
